ogcat):\n```\n[split_config.arm64_v8a.apk!libc++_shared.so] std::__ndk1::recursive_mutex::lock()SIGABRT\n[split_config.arm64_v8a.apk!libgodot_android.so] Java_org_godotengine_godot_GodotLib_stepSIGTRAP\n[libGLES_mali.so]SIGSEGV\n[split_config.arm64_v8a.apk!libgodot_android.so] Java_org_godotengine_godot_GodotLib_stepSIGTRAP\n[split_config.arm64_v8a.apk!libc++_shared.so] std::__ndk1::recursive_mutex::lock()SIGABRT\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nI Dont no\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119626/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}